{
    "note": "pi 压测剧本：每条都是 bash 工具调用（内容全为只读轻量命令），配 --exhausted loop 让 pi 持续多轮工作。每完成一次工具调用消耗一条，循环录制。工具名与形状按 pi 0.85.1 实测：内建工具名全是小写（read/bash/edit/write/grep/find/ls），bash 吃 {\"command\": \"…\"} 的 JSON 对象——与 peri 的 Bash 同名不同形（首字母大小写不同），照抄 scripts/perf-scenario.json 会被 pi 当成未知工具。实测 pi 的一次 prompt 只消费「工具轮次 + 一条收尾」，没有 peri 那样的预测请求、也没有 opencode 的标题生成请求。节奏（delayMs/chunkDelayMs/chunkSize）刻意压小，让 mock 的等待不成为瓶颈，测到的 CPU 主要来自 harness 自身的流解析与工具调度。",
    "defaults": {
        "delayMs": 10,
        "chunkDelayMs": 1,
        "chunkSize": 4
    },
    "responses": [
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "先看一眼当前目录里有什么。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_pi_ls",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "ls" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "再打印一行标记，确认工具链路是通的。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_pi_echo",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "echo llm-mock-perf-tick" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "接下来确认一下工作目录的绝对路径，这一步的文本刻意写长一点，让 SSE 流多切几片，好让 harness 的流式解析有稳定的负载，而不是每次都只处理两三个 chunk 就结束。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_pi_pwd",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "pwd" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "最后看一眼带属性的目录列表。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_pi_ls_la",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "ls -la" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        }
    ]
}
